   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="2">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Essential principles for both corruption prevention and good governance.</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establish corruption reporting mechanisms in the heath sector to generate credible sources of investigative material and create public awareness of the provisions of the Whistle-blower and Witness Protection Act. A friendly system of reporting corruption incidences will be developed, along with empowering investigators with skills to protect whistleblowers and witnesses. Consideration will also be made for the review of the legal framework on protection of whistleblowers in Tanzania to enhance effectiveness.</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline value="13" year="2024"></baseline>
