    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rate at which corruption cases are easily and timely detected, traced, deterred, and convicted</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project will create a change management strategy, action plan and communication strategy to respond to citizen&#x2019;s feedback and measure citizen satisfaction. A change management strategy and action plan will be developed during the first year of Project implementation, thereafter the Project will support implementation to facilitate stakeholder buy&#x2010;in. This platform will also provide a platform to provide their feedback on the e&#x2010;services provided.</narrative>
    </description>
